notes.content:
Dear players, 

No Such Place's Steam Playtest is up and running. Click here to visit the Steam store page, or search for "No Such Place" in your Steam client. Don't forget to add the game to your wishlist and hop into the Playtest!
https://store.steampowered.com/app/3300850

[h3]△What's in the Playtest[/h3]
The Playtest version supports both Chinese and English, with over 2 hours of gameplay that features:
1) Beginers' tutorial & map;
2) One explorable map: the [Origin-00] Forest Region with search points for various supplies/clue items;
3) Gunsmith system: various weapons, attachments, and a highly flexible weapon assembly system;
4) Corruption system: The same attachment can exhibit different abilities based on its degree of corruption, offering more possibilities for customizing your weapon;
5) Mission system: Accept and complete missions to receive rewards. More importantly, this will guide you closer to the truth of the Dimensional Fragments;
6) Character growth system: Gaining experience through exploration and battles enables your character's progression in battlefield abilities.

[h3]△Test Time[/h3]
Starts at noon on April 18, 2025 (UTC+8). Please pay attention to future announcements for the end time. 

[h3]△Feedback[/h3]
Share with us your thoughts in the Steam Discussions or our [url=https://discord.gg/KwbWtZpqPa ]Discord server[/url].

The game is still in the early stages of development, and during the playtest, we will keep an eye on everyone's suggestions and make appropriate adjustments. Development progress will be updated with everyone through Discord, Steam announcements, and other means. Come follow us!
